---
import Clipping from "~/components/Clipping.astro"
import Note from "~/components/Note.astro"

/* Spread 02 — where ideas come from. */
---

<section class="tc-sector is-grid" id="tc-sector-02" aria-label="Page 2: Noticing">
    <p class="spread-head t-eyebrow">
        <span>p. 02</span>
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>wednesday no. 2</span>
    </p>

    <h2 class="spread-title t-display" data-reveal><em>Noticing</em></h2>

    <p class="spread-note t-body">
        Ideas don't arrive. They get noticed. A hinge on a café door. The way
        a receipt folds itself in a pocket and stays folded. We write them
        down before they stop being interesting.
    </p>

    <Clipping
        id="02-0"
        src="spiral"
        caption="the pocket one. always the pocket one."
        x={700}
        y={340}
        w={360}
        h={240}
        kind="riso"
        ink="blue"
    />

    <Clipping
        id="02-1"
        src="pencil"
        caption="HB, 4 wks"
        x={1110}
        y={300}
        w={190}
        h={300}
        kind="polaroid"
        rotate={4}
    />

    <Note x={150} y={420} w={240} rotate={-3}>
        receipt, folded 3× — keeps its shape? why?
    </Note>

    <Note x={430} y={560} rotate={2} size="sm" tone="blue" arrow="right">see p. 5</Note>
</section>
